					"numinlets" : 1,
					"numoutlets" : 0,
					"patching_rect" : [ 15.0, 124.0, 689.0, 60.0 ],
					"text" : "Every voice of bach.roll and bach.score now has a notation style. It defaults to \"et\" (equal tempered), but in the Just Intontation primer we have seen that it can be set to \"ji\" (just intonation). There's yet another possibility: \"linpitch\". This creates a vertical space where pitch flows uniformly (equal intervals in cents corresponding to equal vertical segments). It is displayed as in a classic piano roll."
